  "R4" [label="(0,0,0) Organic-inorganic hybrid covalent superlattice materials are presented as promising gas-sensing materials that may balance gas sensitivity with photoelectric performance, and their distinctive multi-quantum-well structure supports amplified photoelectric response through quantum-confinement effects."];
